negLexMatrix -- a local (series) monomial ordering matrix for the input of arcs
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        negLexMatrix(d)
  * Inputs:
      * d, the dimension, a positive integer
  * Outputs:
      * negLexMatrix, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, negative lex d
        imes d matrix

Description
===========

+-------------------------+
|i1 : M = negLexMatrix 10;|
|                         |
|              11       11|
|o1 : Matrix ZZ   <-- ZZ  |
+-------------------------+

The rings should be poly rings over poly rings with local monomial orderings to
emphasize series

